    {
      "text_as_received": "CHARLIE MUNGER: I think what led to the crisis involved, to some extent, a lack of integrity in many a management. Fortunately, some of them are now gone. So, integrity's very important.",
      "publisher_attributes": {
        "data-speaker": "",
        "class": ""
      },
      "id": "cnbc-meeting-2010-afternoon-ch17-p005",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "reading_text": "CHARLIE MUNGER: I think what led to the crisis involved, to some extent, a lack of integrity in many a management. Fortunately, some of them are now gone. So, integrity's very important.",
      "reversible_encoding_repairs": [],
      "text_sha256": "8889837dd5884b7238ce6252af3abbd86788c03177ea3334daaed255a7b32915",
