    },
    {
      "text_as_received": "So the Accounting Standard Board backed off. Congress â the Senate â voted 88 to 9 to tell them that, you know, what the hell did the Accounting Standards Board know about accounting, and that the Senate would tell them what accounting was all about.",
      "publisher_attributes": {
        "data-speaker": "",
        "class": ""
      },
      "id": "cnbc-meeting-2010-afternoon-ch17-p015",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "reading_text": "So the Accounting Standard Board backed off. Congress — the Senate — voted 88 to 9 to tell them that, you know, what the hell did the Accounting Standards Board know about accounting, and that the Senate would tell them what accounting was all about.",
      "reversible_encoding_repairs": [
        {
          "before": "â",
          "after": "—",
          "roundtrip_codec": "latin-1"
