    {
      "text_as_received": "When the Accounting Standards Board backed off, they said, \"We'll now say that you can do it one of two ways. Number one is preferred,\" which was to expense. Number two was acceptable, but not preferred.",
      "publisher_attributes": {
        "data-speaker": "",
        "class": ""
      },
      "id": "cnbc-meeting-2010-afternoon-ch17-p016",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "reading_text": "When the Accounting Standards Board backed off, they said, \"We'll now say that you can do it one of two ways. Number one is preferred,\" which was to expense. Number two was acceptable, but not preferred.",
      "reversible_encoding_repairs": [],
      "text_sha256": "e424ca0ee77a96b32d6901365f79dc9edf6fd0debbd6e59891149faf9ebf6774",
      "speaker_label": null,
