        "data-speaker": "",
        "class": ""
      },
      "id": "cnbc-meeting-2010-afternoon-ch17-p029",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "reading_text": "CHARLIE MUNGER: Yeah, what's really interesting on this issue is that so much of the bad behavior does not come from malevolence or overweening greed or anything like that.",
      "reversible_encoding_repairs": [],
      "text_sha256": "2b6ec0a57261161219646cebe6cf43a7babc5dbdf27d411a6b9930403b92d4fb",
      "speaker_label": "CHARLIE MUNGER",
